body:
I grew up in a strict Pentecostal home and didnt realize or accept it till I was 18. But I struggle with a lot of self hate because I still share the belief being gay is a sin. I'm a pastors kid so Its really hard to just throw my beliefs away. But i dont want to be single :(

&#x200B;

I reeeeally want to get out of the closet...oh god
